  <item>
    <title>yo！大家好，我是个热爱铜锣烧的哆啦A梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d5db455a91beebb3508b40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d5db455a91beebb3508b40</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 15:35:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家一听到开场就知道我们要聊啥了，没错，就是多啦a梦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那为什么要聊他呢，因为大家听到的这一期节目的时候，刚好是他的生日，也是老邓我的生日，当然也是9月3日亦是世界反法西斯战争胜利纪念日。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;哆啦A梦得叫老邓作老祖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;哆啦A梦到底有几个名字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大雄的奶奶才是哆啦A梦本梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;看长篇才能吃的饱饱的，而且得反复看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;毕竟重点是道具，还是聊聊道具哇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;老邓只是在搞笑，其实也没那么脏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;可颂一局差点就叫铜锣烧货了···</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;哆啦A梦的爸爸其实是2个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有些道具，只要掏出来就会快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">50:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于哆啦A梦的都市传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3169">52:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;本期重点啊！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3382">56:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于哆啦A梦的冷知识，冷冻的那种</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgByzgECg-rocd9_cqBMk5XlbVu7.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrWIEN6wirCgx9lxJee4rP4IE233.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑：映画30周年記念企画 ドラえもん映画主題歌大全集</span></p>]]></description>
