  <item>
    <title>猴哥，救我！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cc7cdaf78678cbe73ceaa7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cc7cdaf78678cbe73ceaa7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Aug 2024 13:02:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于猴哥，我有话说</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近黑神话悟空太火了，我们就想着聊聊他老人家，我觉得我们这代人都是看80年代西游记才认识到孙悟空的，今天不是什么文学解析或者作品解析哦，单纯就是想猴哥了，开一局聊一聊猴哥。</span></p><span></span><p><span>猴哥，救我！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不黑不吹，黑神话：悟空，真棒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有些话，回甘不错哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;孙悟空在你心里活成了孙悟空的样子了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;猴哥是大家的，不是独家的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有些事想要完成，跟取经的难度没啥区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你不吃这个桃，自然有人会吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;猴哥，我有话想对你说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3334">55:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;推荐环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3946">65:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;该道歉就道歉，哈哈哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9BlHuEjhlz_n8H5lt9eB4HxD0r.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6ZxrnAGE1m2cv9ak-E-2ttl6WS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo0jvlxhmeLermd_hN3eboXKJi5S.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgrqVBOtrSMTeYmFr13iiJDy5XD4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头推荐：我的新衣(feat. Ty. &amp; 王倩倩)歌手：VaVa毛衍七 / 王倩倩 / Ty.</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑推荐：《Slicker than Your Average》Craig David</span></p>]]></description>
