  <item>
    <title>傻人有傻福，但沙碉没有</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a76d4d7349f7a55753248d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a76d4d7349f7a55753248d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 10:22:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>常言道，物以类聚，人以群分，一开始聊是相信的，直到有一天聊遇到了一个沙雕，于是他开始反思，为什么自己和这个沙雕会在一个圈子里，难不成自己也···不，不会的，聊老师今天必须和他划清界限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你有巨物恐惧症吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;快来说说你身边的小可爱都犯过那些傻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;请不要在朋友圈随地大小便</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;那种格局太小的老板，是怎么做上老板的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;职场里的小可爱容易被踩碎哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;遇到笨笨的骗子，就不要太客气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;习惯性反驳别人的小可爱，你遇到过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不要假借正义去作恶，小可爱好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2996">49:56</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;老板，小可爱多少钱一斤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3137">52:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;惹得起，咱就惹，惹不起，咱就磕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4008">66:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;推荐环节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmK23s2CJ65RWW4rhczIjVo-LBuz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《Walkin' On The Sun》Smash Mouth</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐专辑：《Stadium Arcadium》Red Hot Chili Peppers</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Get Free》The Vines</span></p>]]></description>
