  <item>
    <title>旅游这个主题吧就是为了宴请童年的聊老师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668bccf8ae8e21859a6026a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668bccf8ae8e21859a6026a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 11:26:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是个非常特殊的日子,因为邀请了一位从可颂一局开播就一直关注支持到现在的好朋友，尖总，欢迎欢迎(拍手)</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实呢，这次邀请尖总来也是挺唐突的，不夸张的说是连拖带拉才把尖总给架上可颂-局，现在她被我们俩绑在树上，除了嘴，别的地方都动不了呢，旁边架着篝火····因此，为了缓解缓解尖总的紧张情绪，咱们今天豁出去了，陪尖总喝点小酒，由浅入深慢慢聊。（碰一下杯）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5z-z_NGLjS1TwB6bFJR1bth5Sg.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsbzQwHYeBS1gSFZ-j2nB6ZDGbcl.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEeSdgc3_oRP8xqo0qa5ZjP3KHu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FluTl5lDWobM0JtDh3meA7gWl2wD.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvBpsZNgNUmvqrV6wfmAVYC1lGVS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWOF1sjQGwHbxPyBzXaI7iLslxA.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4SsUfMtZtl7j1zfuR990O4e9DA.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2f3T9lItbsT8xV6z9x-zM5Nhtn.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZvl2-ac_mqa4sFSEpnuspu3i91.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhgI-WVMzMCu9KG8mi8JoAy4njde.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《Three Little Birds》Bob Marley</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑推荐：《Soul Almighty - The Early Years》Bob Marley</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《No Woman, No Cry》Bob Marley</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天时间轴···不想做了···主要是向往牙买加···正在考虑往行李箱塞什么花色的沙滩裤。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljW9CYmI_NtIdcjIJ51fnQPIiI2j.m4a" length="75178022" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyjarFLnXRmQui5nA0cmaCACS5L.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我为鲶鱼夜话的粉丝做了一期节目！夜话人亲历诡事，阿修罗诵经护体！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668188f9cdd230b23b47e367</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668188f9cdd230b23b47e367</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 16:34:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>鲶鱼来袭，可颂一局</span></p><span></span><p><span>长夜漫漫，行者慌慌，世间妖魔不知做人更难，仙气凝三，和风八荒，心里挂霜不如饮下这碗孟婆暖汤。今天各位来着了，老邓我今天是下了决心，豁出去了，把鲶鱼夜话的老于和缪缪请进局子里，说说一些鲶鱼夜话不能播的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼夜话来自于某件诡异事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;录着录着，三个人主播消失了一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼主播诡异事件之《壮汉内急找厕所，突遇阿飘来打墙，无奈肚子实在疼，电梯井里XXX》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼主播诡异事件之《壮汉夜晚遭噪音，可惜老于没听清，麦克风儿录不进，壮汉强撑不失禁》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼主播诡异事件之《壮汉房间柜子响，门外又发桌椅响，爸妈出差未返还，吓得壮汉躲上床》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">32:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼主播诡异事件之《小壮汉，回家晚，路过一个尼姑俺，一不小心XXX》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼主播诡异事件之《壮汉半夜睡得香，突发小孩笑声惨，世间再无恐怖事，管他那个睡个香》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼夜话主播，木乃伊式午休···</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼录制节目的某个深夜，并没插电源的打印机···突然运作···惊现一张苍白的···XX</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">47:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼百期诡事top！！！高能预警！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4476">74:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;鲶鱼主播祝大家平安顺遂！！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjUCf9enbenpRkl7vBATt7wBeQ-k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGrKc1xhrCVpXrDoe3TbHZma_we.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMW2VPHWk_aDXrg_Yv1NufUHgNG.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuh__0Y8Yi8-Qpi53lMdJfdgCrsx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTwrOkuXQ4Gar1LHRHJlkOfe6Dq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：鲶鱼夜话片头曲《缪缪的XX叫老于》</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Musicology》Prince</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Planet Earth》Prince</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：诡话笑谈片头曲《XOX》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmT5fCf-HEXmPJIMbvctuDjwVC09.m4a" length="76638771" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslfShHq0lOtiylYTPUmc605Ht6D.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>渐行渐远的暑假突然蹦了出来，say hi！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667814b9d3fc5dd627704106</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667814b9d3fc5dd627704106</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 12:27:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;乡下的孩子知道城里的孩子也在乡下过显得很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;对于不同的男孩，诱惑是不一样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于小时候的神秘组织</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;因为发育问题，聊老师的童年暑假是如此的纯粹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;游泳记得要翻面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;自打叶问上映以后，聊老师就对10这个数字情有独钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;地瓜守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;西瓜守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;绿豆守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;街道守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;电视守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">42:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;守卫者也要做作业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2777">46:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;老邓的奶奶天下最好的奶奶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;自然保护区守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3329">55:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;服装外贸公司守卫者上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3545">59:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;可颂一局郑重提醒大家，千万不要在没有保护的情况下游野泳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3802">63:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;谁能帮老邓带个话给周杰伦，老邓每一次失恋都是因为他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4010">66:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;推荐环节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fooddgps1DcjCCgqtpve6SI7sOgu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fidq0h-C-6xLVNxh0nsbOWiC7Gz0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《Belle》Jack Johnson</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《In Between Dreams》Jack Johnson</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Sleep Through The Static》Jack Johnson</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Angel》Jack Johnson</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu6IYZuLMmlnu6lhHczgz-RKtBuB.m4a" length="76449351" type="audio/mp4"/>
