  <item>
    <title>那些关于 shopping#瞎拼#血拼 的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66703c96b6a84127296966ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66703c96b6a84127296966ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 13:39:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知不觉又到年度618购物节，突然发现自己的购物欲一年不如一年，到底是我出了问题，还是购物节出了问题，我们今天开一局来聊聊关于网购的那些个小可爱的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;快来看啊，今年618聊老师又出手买不健康的东西了！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;同学，你打过酱油吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;娶了一位有仪式感的妻子是什么样的体验！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;逛街的乐趣会替你的双腿消肿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;帝王蟹一定要点回家吃才有帝王感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;身边的那些个龙虎豹都是啥样啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;每个星期都要消费一下鲶鱼夜话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;神经病也是要消费的，嗯，你说呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊，去年买了个表，没开玩笑，是真的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2621">43:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于购物节不想购物的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;推荐“黄姐”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6e9dpAYGBtwYSZ7BWTtud_CJrg.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQ1dew7pVm_8UhMjuqx4J5yxb4G.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnDA5dVIKKDy_Cqa8BWcKPjPVwtL.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbjK6ZGm5-35gvoMs8PEuR6WpMN.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTPVw9luPU5ojeL9_a6Brwer6HG.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmd9dbi6nVUYXyojJNiIX_uUYurx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnAd-yTHKuv4Z_lwDPaRyIpdETBH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《This Girl》Cookin' On 3 Burners / Kylie Auldist</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑推荐：《Lovers Rock》Sade</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Count To Five》Rhye</span></p>]]></description>
