  <item>
    <title>一名尴尬症患者与，一名尴尬制造者的自诉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66646b9a94977a26ef17c0b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66646b9a94977a26ef17c0b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Jun 2024 14:32:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>曾经我有一个朋友，年纪轻轻一表人才但是重度尴尬症，也尝试过好多方法，一晃好多年过去了，我这个朋友也终于有了一些变化，变得不再年轻了。所以我们开一局来聊聊”尴尬症“，建议听众朋友到空旷区域收听本期节目，以防脚指头不小心抠穿地板。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;重度尴尬症患者聊上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="273">04:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;重点尴尬制造者老邓上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;半夜被尬醒的人请举手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊对老邓的了解还是有限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;试问，起反应了还不尴尬吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;群聊约多，越容易惹祸，好友越杂，越容易手滑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊走到哪，遇到谁，都觉得别人会抢他球···</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊：我要尬10个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊怕招呼朋友？有没有一种可能是聊怕朋友抢他球？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;开会的笔记本上写，嗯嗯，你说的对，然后呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;老邓在姑娘面前会尴尬？这不合理，也不科学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;自信与自负，到底谁是来讨打的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">47:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;夫妻之间的默契都是尬出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;老邓的脑子一定要快过刀子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3153">52:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;让聊老师尬到几十年睡不好觉的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3394">56:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;让老邓尬到用脚趾抠出了200平米房子的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3578">59:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;解决尴尬的最好办法就是让别人尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3989">66:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;推荐环节，那叫一个上阵父子兵啊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnA2C-guWUBbnEfIBjrVZpBX8O40.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FggSy6Iiw5TyNc4QxaiLFNcEFKud.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场</span></p><span></span><p><span>《"Acceptance Speech"》Asoh Black!</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Give It To Me》Timbaland / Justin Timberlake / Nelly Furtado</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐专辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>《This Is Your Night》Timbaland</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>《We Gotta Let Go》Astels / Renaud Palisseaux</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkEZLmyCWgortqLw4jLUkzjiFIvF.m4a" length="70204652" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVoA5OLtKMDojIuM-F4z3k70_ev.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
