  <item>
    <title>网吧的回忆那么多，不如让我们展开说说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665d876494977a26efdf1a5c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665d876494977a26efdf1a5c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Jun 2024 09:05:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在我们诸多的回忆标识中，最具时代特征的事物里，网吧绝对是其中之翘楚，本期节目在拟大纲的时候，聊老师引用了皮裤王的那首歌《北京北京》歌词，我在这里欢笑，我在这里哭泣，我在这里活着，也在这里死去，我在这里祈祷，我在这里迷惘（mi wang），我在这里寻找，在这里失去···虽然他没我唱的好···我看到的时候，我就说，这期咱们往前排，我有好多话想说···所以我们今天开一局，聊聊网吧回忆录。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊的第一次网聊都聊了些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;每个人身边都有一个那种平时看着傻乎乎的，但是打起字来又巨快的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;自打有了QQ，说话都不用嘴了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聊了一段时间，聊发现，上网聊天，不适合聊（看懂的举手）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;话说老邓，就是个高压锅闷饭，早熟啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;那些个优质资源啊，再也遇不到了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;一手好牌越打越烂，老邓的笑也是越来越浪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;网吧是最早的综艺节目从业者的孵化基地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;可以不睡觉的快乐，真是难以言表</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;这么就聊着聊着就聊尴尬了呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从小就经历，捉什么在什么的人呐，你们现在在何方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;他之前发出的那枚子弹，多年后正中了自己的眉心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;大神自有大神上网的手段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2454">40:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;@鲶鱼夜话 &nbsp;&nbsp;老于，我要投个稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于QQ空间的那些个羞耻的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;聪明人写聪明文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">58:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;那天以后，就再也没有以后了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4121">68:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;哪有正经朋友会和你说这种事情？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4138">68:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;传统的推荐环节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Filv0BjSqdKpwVCA3Tcc9Z31uT-6.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FglWzI0Lg855DuHpmCtVRHoRxtMT.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1-ilXty16RPZArmJpX2EuDCn6k.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEJSg0WX0JqCO9idaANVzxV45q0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXZ_J9sN4a7N0rfQhEcbK9-WucI.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkib2ej2_JiLWQUq4UhsBYH3iDKO.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgtm3ypTgHXdjeNS3Uhbn3y1XfUD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期音乐推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲《Morning In America》Durand Jones / The Indications</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期专辑推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Gorillaz》Gorillaz</span></p><span></span><p><span>《 Demon Days》Gorillaz</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲《Sitting Here In Silence (On My Own)》Oasis</span></p>]]></description>
